Z||000010||DRH||04-23-2001||06:02 PM||||It's been a while so I don't remember exactly how, but I do remember unbolting the whole compressor bracket from the engine. I don't think it was that hard, other than being a little tight to reach. I remember wishing I had done it sooner since I spent a while trying to loosen up just the compressor. <P>I think I had to remove something else first... maybe the bracket holding the dogbone??? some other bracket??? Like I said, it's been a while...||||reg||1
